## Key Concepts
- Retrieval-augmented NLP with real-time fact-checking
- Time-aligned financial data integration (pricing, volume, SEC filings, press releases)
- Multilingual on-device preprocessing with privacy-preserving cloud inference
- Explainability with citations; drift detection; staged deployment

## Code Example
